{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29693","headline":"复至裴明府所居 · 李商隐","name":"复至裴明府所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊人卜筑自幽深，桂巷杉篱不可寻。\n柱上雕虫对书字，槽中瘦马仰听琴。\n求之流辈岂易得，行矣关山方独吟。\n赊取松醪一斗酒，与君相伴洒烦襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}